# Generated native projects (Continuous Native Generation): EAS prebuilds
# ios/ and android/ during the build, but they are absent on this (Linux)
# machine when `eas build` computes the runtime-version fingerprint. Excluding
# them keeps the local and EAS fingerprints identical so EAS Update’s
# CONFIGURE_EXPO_UPDATES phase does not fail on a runtime-version mismatch.
# Native-relevant changes are still captured via package.json, app config, and
# the native module dirs under node_modules.
/ios
/android
